OL,3,GNEWSADaniel Thomas refused bail over
OL,4,Aalleged boat damage
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnti-migrant activist Daniel Thomas has
OL,7,Fbeen refused bail during a crown court
OL,8,Fhearing over the alleged slashing of a
OL,9,Fdinghy in the English Channel.
OL,11,FThomas, known to his supporters as
OL,12,FDanny Tommo, appeared via videolink at
OL,13,FPortsmouth Crown Court accused of
OL,14,Fcriminal damage after a video appeared
OL,15,Fto show him slashing at the boat with a
OL,16,Fknife.
OL,18,FThe 37-year-old, whose address was
OL,19,Fwithheld by the court at a previous
OL,20,Fhearing, is also charged with failing
OL,21,Fto disclose the PIN to his phone.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
